# Gmail via IMAPS. Requires an app password (Google account → Security
# → 2-step verification → App passwords) — regular password auth is
# disabled. IMAP access must be enabled in Gmail settings.
#
# Gmail's Maildir mapping treats All Mail / Trash / Spam as "special
# folders". Patterns above filters to visible folders by default;
# adjust MAIL_FOLDERS in .env if you want All Mail (`[Gmail]/All Mail`).

IMAPAccount gmail
Host ${MAIL_HOST}
Port ${MAIL_PORT}
User ${MAIL_USER}
PassCmd "echo $MAIL_PASSWORD"
SSLType ${MAIL_SSL}
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path /var/mail/
Inbox /var/mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns ${MAIL_FOLDERS}
Create Near
Sync Pull
Expunge None
SyncState *
MaxMessages ${MAIL_MAX_MESSAGES}
MaxSize ${MAIL_MAX_SIZE}
